1
00:00:00,361 --> 00:00:02,991
(Leonard:)When you were telling Kevin
about your acting career...

2
00:00:03,197 --> 00:00:05,827
(Leonard:)...did you mention your long-running
role as waitress...

3
00:00:05,991 --> 00:00:09,411
(Leonard:)...in a local production
of The Cheesecake Factory?

4
00:00:10,454 --> 00:00:12,794
(Penny:)Did you tell her
about your lucky asthma inhaler?

5
00:00:14,124 --> 00:00:16,334
(Leonard:)Oh, yeah? Spell asthma.

6
00:00:18,504 --> 00:00:21,004
(Sheldon:)A- S...

7
00:00:21,215 --> 00:00:22,965
(Penny:)Take me home.

8
00:00:23,133 --> 00:00:24,763
(Leonard:)Maybe I'm not done hanging out...

9
00:00:27,930 --> 00:00:30,220
(Leonard:)You're right, it's getting late.

10
00:00:35,896 --> 00:00:37,686
(Sheldon:)It's remarkable.

11
00:00:37,856 --> 00:00:41,906
All that time spent in fear. For what?

12
00:00:42,069 --> 00:00:44,239
(Sheldon:)He's magnificent.

13
00:00:45,030 --> 00:00:56,020
Ah! Oh, dear. I just realized
I haven't offered you a beverage.

